  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Semblance.Interaction.InspectableObject
  prompt: Read the plan
  description: 'The archive, drawn up when the stacks went in and pinned at the door ever since. The sheet''s turned the way you''re facing: the boiler room is at the top, past the cage. Somebody''s pencilled the way through as far as the far block. After that there''s a coffee ring, and you''re on your own.'
  messageDuration: 5
  clueKey: 
